  "id": "BIT-mongodb-2026-13065",
  "summary": "MongoDB $linearFill Window Function Improper Input Validation Leading to Process Termination",
  "details": "A user with read-only privileges is able to craft an aggregation pipeline using the $linearFill window function operator with a specific sortBy expression type to cause the mongod process to terminate abnormally, resulting in denial of service. The issue stems from insufficient validation of sort specifications during execution.",
